  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 5.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hine hwa feormige syððan, bete swa seo domboc sæcge, ⁊ se scyle ðe flyman feormige, gif hit sy herinne; gif hit sy east inne, gif hit sy norð inne, bete be ðam þe þa friðgewritu sæcgen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone subsequently harbours him, he shall pay such compensation as the written laws declare of him who harbours a fugitive, if the offence is committed in his own kingdom. If the offence is committed in the eastern or northern kingdoms, compensation shall be paid in accordance with the provision of the treaties.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hine hwa feormige syððan, bete swa seo domboc secge, ⁊ se scyle ðe flyman feormie, gif hit sy herinne; gif hit sy east inne, gif hit sy norð inne, bete be ðam ðe ða friðgewritu secgen.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
